  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Africa Power Pool (EAPP) - EAPP Power Pool E Afr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East Africa Power Pool (EAPP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den f&#xf6;reslagna Norska - Svenska programmet (programmet) om tekniskt   bist&#xe5;nd f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra genomf&#xf6;rande och operationalisering av EAPP Coordination Centre (CC) och oberoende tillsynsmyndighet (IRB) m&#xe5;l    byggandet av grundl&#xe4;ggande m&#xe4;nskliga resurser och kompetens f&#xf6;r att   inleda regionala makten handeln under kommande 3-&#xe5;rsperiod.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Norwegian - Swedish Programme (the Program) on Technical Assistance for Enhancing the Implementation &amp; Operationalization of   the EAPP Coordination Centre  (CC) and Independent Regulatory Body    (IRB)  targets building of basic human resources and skills for       initiating the regional power trade during the coming 3-year period.</narrative>
  </description>
